7480621,2023-09-01,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Problem with a purchase shown on your statement,Card was charged for something you did not purchase with the card,"On XX/XX/XXXX in the attached picture, I clicked on an ad which offered free samples of sunscreen. I was charged the shipping amounts below : XX/XX/XXXX XX/XX/XXXX XXXX XXXX CA {$5.00} XX/XX/XXXX XX/XX/XXXX XXXX XXXX CA {$6.00} I made no further purchases with the seller. I left for a trip on XX/XX/XXXX to XXXX XXXX and returned XX/XX/XXXX ( which I can provide flight information for ). I returned to find two additional unauthorized purchases for large amounts on my card, one apparently made on the day I was on my flight. The fraudulent seller kept my card information. I received no product or service. 

