7486069,2023-09-02,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Old information reappears or never goes away,"Three over 7 year-old accounts must be removed from my credit files in the absence of any proof of 'Date of Last Payment ' that has been arbitrarily & erroneously set by the creditors. 

