7538880,2023-09-12,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Problem using a debit or ATM card,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, MI, XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX Consumer Financial Protection Bureau 1700 G Street NW Washington, D.C. XXXX Subject : Formal Complaint against Axos Bank XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX for Regulation E Violation Dear Sir/Madam, I hope this letter finds you in good health. I am writing to file a formal complaint against Axos Bank, doing business as Skylight One, for a violation of Regulation E under the Electronic Fund Transfer Act ( EFTA ). I believe that the actions of the bank have infringed upon my rights as a consumer and have caused me financial harm. 

