7580224,2023-09-20,Debt collection,Medical debt,Communication tactics,"You told them to stop contacting you, but they keep trying","Cascade Capital LLC [ XXXX Old XXXX XXXX ] [ XXXX, CA, Zip XXXX ] [ XXXX ] [ XXXX ] Re : Pre-Arbitration Demand Letter Pursuant to the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ) and Unlicensed Debt Collection in the State of Georgia Dear Sir/Madam, I am writing to bring to your attention several serious concerns regarding your debt collection activities as they pertain to me, [ XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX and to demand immediate resolution of these issues prior to the initiation of arbitration proceedings or federal court proceedings. 
