7590403,2023-09-23,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"To whom it may concern, I am writing to file a formal complaint against XXXX XXXX XXXX regarding the inaccurate reporting of my account status to credit reporting agencies. Despite adhering to the provisions and protections offered under the CARES Act, XXXX XXXX XXXX has reported my account as "" payment past due, '' which has negatively impacted my credit score and overall credit history. 

